@Products.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5051

### Create a product
POST {{Products.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "4K Monitor",
  "price": 349.99
}

### Get all products
GET {{Products.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Get a product by id (seeded)
GET {{Products.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Validation error example
POST {{Products.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -10
}

### Not found example
GET {{Products.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/999
Accept: application/json
